{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECTRAL PRISON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape an ever-changing prison in a horror experience where each loop reshapes your nightmare and reveals a darker truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CYCLE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shifting House:</strong> Start each loop in a familiar bedroom, but explore a house that rearranges itself. Corridors twist, rooms multiply, and nothing is where you left it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260000/extras/d2575399a89dad43cd3878c1fc9086c6.poster.avif?t=1773340669\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260000/extras/d2575399a89dad43cd3878c1fc9086c6.webm?t=1773340669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260000/extras/d2575399a89dad43cd3878c1fc9086c6.mp4?t=1773340669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Warden's Game:</strong> &quot;Escape&quot; only to be thrown into the Warden's domain\u2014a hostile forest and a ghost-filled maze, each more dangerous than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape. Expand. Repeat.</strong> Each successful escape expands the prison, introducing new rooms, harder puzzles, and deadlier realms.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the Keys:</strong> Your primary tool. Their locations are randomized every run. Stay alert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Domains:</strong> Outrun Wardens in the forest, manage line-of-sight with ghosts in the maze, and solve environmental puzzles in the cabin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The &quot;Troll Room&quot;:</strong> Face a unique challenge where you must find the single real key among hundreds of perfect fakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260000/extras/aaf8c27f69f388e37085fb2e15b2971e.poster.avif?t=1773340669\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260000/extras/aaf8c27f69f388e37085fb2e15b2971e.webm?t=1773340669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260000/extras/aaf8c27f69f388e37085fb2e15b2971e.mp4?t=1773340669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME DETAILS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime:</strong> 1-3 hours for the core narrative loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Experience:</strong> Procedural key placement and evolving level design ensure no two runs feel identical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Complete Story:</strong> A self-contained, psychological horror narrative with a definitive beginning and end.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Legendary Nut Chaser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3260000/13d3ac4a438fe0c1691eb19e1674d6582187c14d.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Book Of The Remember","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3260000/d7233822bde0faaae41f911b03f3827f3334fecf.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Grated Moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3260000/94473c869dfce68bf1c03cd14d8aaad2c6a4c9c7.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Doofus Trickster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/ste